      "Did anyone give you a “nice person card”?",
      "",
      "If you expressed your love to a person you like, and were turned down because “you are too nice”, ..",
      ".. then this is a situation where we can say you were given a “nice person card”.",
      "It means someone wants to turn you down, but don't want to hurt you, ..",
      ".. so they say some nice words to make you feel better.",
      "Even though a “nice person card” has a good intention, no one is happy to receive it.",
      "People usually give out “nice person cards” by saying something like this:",
      "",
      "“You are great, but I’m not good enough.”",
      "",
